 to October 37 times in 75 years, the most of any pair. In 2025 that middle ran 146% of normal in May to June and 50% in November to December. So far in 2026 it shows 48% in February to March and 131% in June to July. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, with grid 18175 at 56%.</p>"}
